    /**
     * Extracts entries supplied by {@code supplier} into {@code targetDirectory}.
     *
     * <p>This method performs rigorous path validation to prevent path‑traversal attacks.
     * It rejects absolute paths, entries containing {@code ..}, or any form of
     * directory traversal. All paths are resolved against the canonical target
     * directory and normalized before any file system operations are performed.</p>
